es the risk.\"><p>Polymarket asks this downturn by December 31, 2026 and by June 30, 2027 on identical rules (three of six triggers inside 90 days). May 18 falls between; I read the date at a constant daily hazard between the two deadlines, since no scheduled date concentrates the risk.</p></div></div><button class=\"linkish more\" type=\"button\" data-more>Show more</button></div></div><div class=\"basis note\"><div class=\"fold\"><div class=\"fold-in\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"A blockade of or attack on Taiwan would itself meet the downturn market&#x27;s triggers: Nvidia 50% below its record, the semiconductor index 40% below, and TSMC 50% below are three of the six, and my Taiwan row puts all three there.\"><p>A blockade of or attack on Taiwan would itself meet the downturn market&#x27;s triggers: Nvidia 50% below its record, the semiconductor index 40% below, and TSMC 50% below are three of the six, and my Taiwan row puts all three there.</p></div></div><button class=\"linkish more\" type=\"button\" data-more>Show more</button></div></div><p class=\"raw\"><a class=\"rawlink\" data-go=\"raw:value:structure:prop:2\">Full details</a></p>", "wide": true}